              "correct": false
            }
          ],
          "explanation": "21 = 7 × 3 : 7x + 21 = 7(x + 3). En développant 7(x + 21), on obtiendrait 7x + 147."
        },
        {
          "id": "ex-reduire-trois-x",
          "type": "exercise",
